<title>UK: TABLE-Scottish Hydro yr pretax profits rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Scottish Hydro yr pretax profits rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  42.4		 vs   38.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   12.36		vs    N/A</p>
